=== let café = 1
error[Q0009]: the name `café` is not in the standard Unicode form
 --> example.ql:1:5
  |
1 | let café = 1
  |     ^^^^^ this name mixes separate accents with letters
  |
  = note: names must be in Unicode Normalization Form C (NFC), so that two names that look the same are the same
help: write it as `café`
  |
1 | let café = 1
  |

