=== \"a}b\"
error[Q0036]: a single `}` in a string doesn't close anything
 --> example.ql:1:3
  |
1 | "a}b"
  |   ^ no `{` is open here
  |
help: for a literal brace, write `}}`
  |
1 | "a}}b"
  |

=== \"{}\"
error[Q0037]: this `{}` in a string is empty
 --> example.ql:1:2
  |
1 | "{}"
  |  ^^ a value must go between `{` and `}`
  |
help: for literal braces, write `{{}}`
  |
1 | "{{}}"
  |

=== \"{ }\"
error[Q0037]: this `{}` in a string is empty
 --> example.ql:1:2
  |
1 | "{ }"
  |  ^^^ a value must go between `{` and `}`
  |
help: for literal braces, write `{{ }}`
  |
1 | "{{ }}"
  |

=== \"{:.2}\"
error[Q0038]: this `{` has a format spec but no value
 --> example.ql:1:2
  |
1 | "{:.2}"
  |  ^^^^^ no value before the `:`
  |
  = help: put the value before the `:`, as in `{price:.2}`
help: for literal braces, double them
  |
1 | "{{:.2}}"
  |

=== print(\"Use { to start a block\")
error[Q0039]: this `{` starts a value inside the string, but it is never closed
 --> example.ql:1:12
  |
1 | print("Use { to start a block")
  |            ^ the line ends before the matching `}`
  |
help: for a literal brace, write `{{`
  |
1 | print("Use {{ to start a block")
  |
  = help: for JSON, use a raw string such as `#"{"a": 1}"#`

=== \"{x:.2\"
error[Q0039]: this `{` starts a value inside the string, but it is never closed
 --> example.ql:1:2
  |
1 | "{x:.2"
  |  ^ the line ends before the matching `}`
  |
help: for a literal brace, write `{{`
  |
1 | "{{x:.2"
  |
  = help: for JSON, use a raw string such as `#"{"a": 1}"#`

=== \"{x // note}\"
error[Q0040]: comments can't go inside `{ }` in a string
 --> example.ql:1:5
  |
1 | "{x // note}"
  |     ^^^^^^^ comment inside a string's `{ }`
  |
help: remove the comment, or move it after the string
  |
1 | "{x }"
  |

=== \"{x /* note */}\"
error[Q0040]: comments can't go inside `{ }` in a string
 --> example.ql:1:5
  |
1 | "{x /* note */}"
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^ comment inside a string's `{ }`
  |
help: remove the comment, or move it after the string
  |
1 | "{x }"
  |

=== \"{x:}\"
error[Q0041]: this format spec is empty
 --> example.ql:1:4
  |
1 | "{x:}"
  |    ^ invalid format spec
  |
  = note: a format spec is written `[width][.precision][kind]`, as in `.2` (two decimals), `5` (at least 5 characters) or `02x` (hex, padded with zeros to 2 characters)
help: remove the `:`
  |
1 | "{x}"
  |

=== \"{x: .2}\"
error[Q0041]: ` .2` is not a valid format spec
 --> example.ql:1:4
  |
1 | "{x: .2}"
  |    ^^^^ invalid format spec
  |
  = note: a format spec is written `[width][.precision][kind]`, as in `.2` (two decimals), `5` (at least 5 characters) or `02x` (hex, padded with zeros to 2 characters)
help: remove the spaces
  |
1 | "{x:.2}"
  |

=== \"{x:.2f}\"
error[Q0041]: `.2f` is not a valid format spec
 --> example.ql:1:4
  |
1 | "{x:.2f}"
  |    ^^^^ invalid format spec
  |
  = note: a format spec is written `[width][.precision][kind]`, as in `.2` (two decimals), `5` (at least 5 characters) or `02x` (hex, padded with zeros to 2 characters)
help: remove the format spec
  |
1 | "{x}"
  |

=== \"{\"a\": 1}\"
error[Q0041]: ` 1` is not a valid format spec
 --> example.ql:1:6
  |
1 | "{"a": 1}"
  |      ^^^ invalid format spec
  |
  = note: a format spec is written `[width][.precision][kind]`, as in `.2` (two decimals), `5` (at least 5 characters) or `02x` (hex, padded with zeros to 2 characters)
  = help: to write JSON or other text with braces, use a raw string, such as `#"{"a": 1}"#`

